---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Projects
intro: Products, programs, and tools I've built, with what they set out to do and what they actually achieved.
description: Projects by David DeWinter, including RowHero, Northforge, and a YouTube analytics pipeline.
permalink: /projects/
---
{%- for project in projects %}
<article class="project" id="{{ project.title | slugify }}">
  <div class="project-aside">
    <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
    <h2>{{ project.title }}</h2>
    <p class="card-meta">{{ project.role }} · {{ project.years }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="project-body">
    <p class="lede">{{ project.summary }}</p>
    {%- if project.details %}<p>{{ project.details }}</p>{% endif %}
    {%- if project.highlights.length %}
    <ul class="highlights">
      {%- for item in project.highlights %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if project.tags.length %}
    <ul class="chip-list" aria-label="Areas">
      {%- for tag in project.tags %}<li class="chip">{{ tag }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if project.link %}<p><a class="card-link" href="{{ project.link }}">Visit {{ project.title }} →</a></p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</article>
{%- endfor %}
